{"id":"steam-1110760","steam":1110760,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Causality: Antopolia","summary":"Survive a collapsing totalitarian regime in this story-rich dystopian RPG. Explore a brutalist semi-open world, master tactical first-person combat, and make critical choices. Shape the fate of the country and your own.","about":"THE SYSTEM IS CRUMBLING, IT SEEMS...\n\nThe Allmighty co-Premier commits suicide the day before his re-election. The radios buzz with propaganda, military police floods the streets, and a brutal gang war erupts in the eastern districts. You are Victor, a social recluse who is unable to speak to 99% of the population due to your unique muteness. You lived your quiet life unaffected by the regime until the leader of a certain unpopular party knocked on your door.\n\n  \n\nA VAST TOTALITARIAN WORLD \n\nExplore the city of Antopolia during its day and night cycle. Immerse yourself in a dark and gritty atmosphere dominated by oppressive brutalist architecture and the watchful eyes of government enforcers. The game allows you to explore 3 massive districts with multiple sub-levels, plus additional areas unlocked through the main hero’s childhood flashbacks.\n\nCHALLENGING FIRST-PERSON COMBAT\n\nMaster a dynamic battle system featuring combos, timed attacks, QTEs and tactical decision-making. The stronger the enemy, the quicker and smarter you'll have to be.\n\nUNCOVER THE TRUTH\n\nDive into deep, believable lore through an impressive amount of non-linear side quests, hidden dialogues, and alternate playable characters. Get the full picture of what is going on in this haunting city of Antopolia.\n\nDISTRACT YOURSELF FROM THE DYSTOPIA\n\nTake a break from the revolution and have a blast with computer and arcade games, cooking, underground sports betting on guinea pig races, and so much more!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/965f171a2a0d5ab9c28fdd2e150522caeaaef92f/library_capsule.jpg?t=1792974012","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/0546e1393732cd2b237244f1e9eaa59285aca688/header.jpg?t=1792974012","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/7941af360a2861b7d760f41072d9270aceb22eb1/library_hero.jpg?t=1792974012","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/0546e1393732cd2b237244f1e9eaa59285aca688/header.jpg?t=1792974012","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/26436c3878b5429da06f5a96787fe64027c237ab/ss_26436c3878b5429da06f5a96787fe64027c237ab.600x338.jpg?t=1792974012","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/26436c3878b5429da06f5a96787fe64027c237ab/ss_26436c3878b5429da06f5a96787fe64027c237ab.jpg?t=1792974012"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/7708e8579b3ea0fdd15f4586acaa550cca33ab5c/ss_7708e8579b3ea0fdd15f4586acaa550cca33ab5c.600x338.jpg?t=1792974012","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/7708e8579b3ea0fdd15f4586acaa550cca33ab5c/ss_7708e8579b3ea0fdd15f4586acaa550cca33ab5c.jpg?t=1792974012"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/9b47c35616733c53f4254796ec8a7de610d55b00/ss_9b47c35616733c53f4254796ec8a7de610d55b00.600x338.jpg?t=1792974012","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/9b47c35616733c53f4254796ec8a7de610d55b00/ss_9b47c35616733c53f4254796ec8a7de610d55b00.jpg?t=1792974012"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/7289b01d28769cec4d6dc66117392662c2f61482/ss_7289b01d28769cec4d6dc66117392662c2f61482.600x338.jpg?t=1792974012","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1110760/7289b01d28769cec4d6dc66117392662c2f61482/ss_7289b01d28769cec4d6dc661